{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04293","headline":"奉和宴小山池赋得谿字应制 · 武三思","name":"奉和宴小山池赋得谿字应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年光开碧沼，云色歛青谿。\n冻解鱼方戏，风暄鸟欲啼。\n岩泉飞野鹤，石镜舞山鸡。\n柳发龙鳞出，松新麈尾齐。\n九韶从此验，三月定应迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武三思","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}